# What git leaves out of the Udgam maths pipeline. A clone needs: `npm install` in each class folder, its own
# `.env` and `config.json` (see .env.example, config.example.json and README.md "After a clone"), nothing else.
# Kept in git on purpose: the ported tools (class*/output-preview/: each tool's TSX + JSON, the pair the viewer shows and the host runs), the code (class*/lib, cli.mjs, runtime/runtime.tsx, runtime/frozen/** = the immutable
# runtimes every chapter is pinned to, viewer sources, docs), each tool's source and its records in work/
# (tool.tsx, voice.tsx, images.tsx/json, brief.md, slot.json, status.json, runtime.json, mounts.md), the root runbook,
# classctl, _templates/, .claude/ (agents, skills, commands, hook, settings.json) and the mascot (kiko.svg; mascot.png, the old robot, stays: runtimes r1 to r52 were made from it).

# ---- secrets and machine state: never commit ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
config.json
.fence.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.lock

# ---- installed or rebuilt by a command (npm install; node cli.mjs view; node cli.mjs check/port) ----
node_modules
class*/viewer/public/bundle.*
.build

# ---- local caches: a clone makes its own (TTS clips, raw Gemini pictures and their cost ledger, sync bases) ----
class*/.voice-cache/
class*/.images-cache/
class*/.classctl/

# ---- made again by every run inside work/ ----
class*/work/**/plan.json
class*/work/**/*.preview.html
class*/work/**/*.png
class*/work/**/*.jpg
class*/work/**/*.jpeg
class*/work/**/*.webp
class*/work/**/*.gif
class*/work/**/voice.tsx.off
class*/work/**/pack/
class*/work/**/readlist.md
# orchestration (orch.mjs): state.json, ckpt/, reports/ and HANDOFF.md stay in git (a session resumes from them, on any machine);
# the tool snapshots, follower read lists, the lock and the owner's session reading are made again
class*/work/*/orch/snap/
class*/work/*/orch/readlist/
class*/work/*/orch/.lock
class*/work/.orch-runtime.json.tmp
usage-reports/.session.json

# ---- third-party material, backups and scratch ----
*.pdf
_archive/
_backups/
_regression*/
_unify-work/
.playwright-mcp/
*.tmp
*.tmp.mjs
*.log
NUL
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.jpeg
/textbooks